If tomorrow comes, I'll be grateful where I'm at,

40
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:29,220
If tomorrow doesn't come, tell my people that I laughed.

41
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,440
Purple satellites...

42
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:35,500
Can you hear me calling?

43
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,680
